{{!
    The "Start scan" form, and the line that points at it.

    This is a partial because the form is needed in two places. The form used to
    sit inside the "hasscan" section only, so a site that had never been scanned
    was told to "start one" while the page offered no way to do it. The guidance
    line is guarded by the same conditions as the form itself, so the page can
    never promise a button that is not on it.

    Context: canrunscan, hastargets, formhtml, welcomestartscan.
}}
{{#canrunscan}}
{{#hastargets}}
<p class="mb-2">{{welcomestartscan}}</p>
<div class="mt-3">{{{formhtml}}}</div>
{{/hastargets}}
{{/canrunscan}}
